# Optional performance tuning (only when "Performance tuning" is ticked).
# Source: Najip/android_kernel_a325F_bakasu (a32-perf, LumiROM A32 4G PERF
# variant). Use together with patches/kernel/0002-optional-tuning.patch.
# GPU 1100 MHz @ 1.035 V, CCI overclock, CPU/CCI undervolt, DDR DVFS tweaks,
# BORE scheduler, 250 Hz, schedutil, BBR and fq_codel.
CONFIG_SLM_OC_GPU=y
CONFIG_SLM_OC_CCI=y
CONFIG_SLM_OC_RAMDVFS=y
CONFIG_SLM_UV=y
CONFIG_SCHED_BORE=y
# CONFIG_HZ_100 is not set
CONFIG_HZ_250=y
# CONFIG_HZ_300 is not set
# CONFIG_HZ_1000 is not set
CONFIG_HZ=250
CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_GOV_SCHEDUTIL=y
CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_DEFAULT_GOV_SCHEDUTIL=y
# CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_DEFAULT_GOV_CONSERVATIVE is not set
# CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_DEFAULT_GOV_PERFORMANCE is not set
# CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_DEFAULT_GOV_POWERSAVE is not set
CONFIG_TCP_CONG_ADVANCED=y
CONFIG_TCP_CONG_BBR=y
# CONFIG_DEFAULT_BIC is not set
# CONFIG_DEFAULT_CUBIC is not set
CONFIG_DEFAULT_BBR=y
CONFIG_DEFAULT_TCP_CONG="bbr"
CONFIG_NET_SCH_FQ_CODEL=y
CONFIG_NET_SCH_FQ=y
CONFIG_NET_SCH_DEFAULT=y
# CONFIG_DEFAULT_FQ is not set
CONFIG_DEFAULT_FQ_CODEL=y
# CONFIG_DEFAULT_PFIFO_FAST is not set
CONFIG_DEFAULT_NET_SCH="fq_codel"
